ttps://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hostile-mobs-and-girls\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hostile Mobs and Girls (HMaG)</a> (by <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/Mechalopa/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mechalopa</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ice-and-fire-dragons\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ice and Fire: Dragons</a> (by <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/sbom_xela/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">sbom_xela</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minecolonies\" rel=\"nofollow\">MineColonies</a> (by <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/Raycoms/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">Raycoms</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mob-lassos\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mob Lassos [Forge &amp; Fabric]</a> (by <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/Fuzs/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fuzs</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutant-monsters\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mutant Monsters [Forge &amp; Fabric]</a> (by <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/Fuzs/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fuzs</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mythic-mounts-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mythic Mounts (Forge)</a> (by chirpycricket)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nyfs-genetics\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nyf's Genetics</a> (by <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/Nyfaria/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nyfaria</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nyfs-spiders\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nyf's Spiders</a> (by <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/Nyfaria/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nyfaria</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/playerrevive\" rel=\"nofollow\">PlayerRevive</a> (by <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/CreativeMD/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">CreativeMD</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/starcatcher\" rel